      "created_at": "2025-07-16T06:14:09.027Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can you tell me what your message said?</p>\n<p>I managed to fix it by allowing guest access to the function.</p>\n<p><code>@frappe.whitelist(allow_guest=True)</code></p>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<p>{<br>\n“message”: “Guest”<br>\n}</p>",
