      "created_at": "2025-07-16T11:29:09.520Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sideroomghost\">@sideroomghost</a></p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">curl --location 'http://development.localhost:8000/api/method/frappe.auth.get_logged_user' \\\n--header 'Authorization: token 24e98a3077bdd0e:b55fa1fdb01cecb' \\\n--header 'Cookie: full_name=Guest; sid=Guest; system_user=no; user_id=Guest; user_image='\n</code></pre>\n<p>Just change your user key and secret no need to change frappe code</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5eef89f15b0becb5ac42a7999a77558f30b0093d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5eef89f15b0becb5ac42a7999a77558f30b0093d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5eef89f15b0becb5ac42a7999a77558f30b0093d_2_690x266.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dxQ5GWN8DyEtinBBnmWkeTZzqXP\" width=\"690\" height=\"266\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5eef89f15b0becb5ac42a7999a77558f30b0093d_2_690x266.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/e/5eef89f15b0becb5ac42a7999a77558f30b0093d_2_1035x399.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/e/5eef89f15b0becb5ac42a7999a77558f30b0093d.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFBFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1358×524 42 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
